Description: Backport appsrc test synchronization from GStreamer 1.26.4
 The expected event list is consumed by a streaming thread while the test
 thread appends to it. Protect both sides with a mutex so the arm64 package
 test does not race and report events in an impossible order.
Origin: upstream, GStreamer 1.26.4
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-08-28

diff --git a/tests/check/elements/appsrc.c b/tests/check/elements/appsrc.c
index 699587b8..46ab62b1 100644
